<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon upgrades 3Com.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon upgrades 3Com.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers analyst Peter Schwartz said he raised his rating on 3Com Corp stock to a buy from a hold and initiated a share price target of $60.</p>
<p>-- Schwartz maintained his fiscal 1998 earnings estimate of $2.40 a share and fiscal 1999 estimate of $3.10.</p>
<p>-- 3Com shares were up 2-7/8 at 47-5/16 early Wednesday afternoon.</p>
<p>-- Schwartz said the computer-networking company was on track to show above-trend earnings growth of 25 to 30 percent as a result of its acquisition of U.S. Robotics, a strong new product cycle in each of its market segments and further gains in its share of the adapter-card market.</p>
</text>
